---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Return Policy"
  description="Return and refund policy for The Legit Launch by Aspect Media Holdings, LLC. 7-day money-back guarantee on the POD business course."
>

  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Refunds and returns</p>
      <h1>Return Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated August 24, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-body">
    <div class="container-narrow legal-content">

      <p><strong>7-day money-back guarantee.</strong> If The Legit Launch is not right for you, request a full refund within 7 days of purchase. No questions asked.</p>

      <h2>How to Request a Refund</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@thelegitlaunch.com?subject=REFUND%20REQUEST">hello@thelegitlaunch.com</a> with the subject line <strong>REFUND REQUEST</strong>.</p>
      <p>Include:</p>
      <ol>
        <li>The email address you used to purchase the course</li>
        <li>The date of purchase</li>
      </ol>
      <p>You do not need to explain why. We honor requests on request.</p>

      <h2>Eligibility</h2>
      <p>You are eligible for a full refund if all of these are true:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Your request is submitted within 7 days of your purchase date</li>
        <li>You purchased the course through our official Payhip checkout</li>
      </ul>
      <p>After 7 days, purchases are final and no refunds will be issued.</p>

      <h2>How Refunds Are Processed</h2>
      <p>Refunds are issued to the original payment method through Payhip. Typical processing time:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>We approve the refund within 2 business days of your request</li>
        <li>Payhip processes the refund within 3 to 5 business days</li>
        <li>Funds appear on your original payment method within 5 to 10 business days depending on your bank or card issuer</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Once a refund is processed, your access to the course is revoked. Any downloaded materials remain your responsibility to delete per the course license terms.</p>

      <h2>Non-Refundable Items</h2>
      <p>The following are not eligible for refund:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Purchases older than 7 days</li>
        <li>Course access purchased through third-party promotions or bundles outside our official Payhip checkout</li>
        <li>Bonuses that have already been delivered or redeemed (e.g., Launch Week Q&A call seat that has already been attended)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Chargebacks</h2>
      <p>If you initiate a chargeback with your bank or card issuer without first contacting us for a refund, we reserve the right to dispute the chargeback and terminate your course access. Please email us first. We will honor eligible refund requests without dispute.</p>

      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions about this Return Policy, email <a href="mailto:hello@thelegitlaunch.com">hello@thelegitlaunch.com</a>.</p>

      <address class="post-address">
        Aspect Media Holdings, LLC<br>
        2636 Indian Springs Road<br>
        Marianna, FL 32446<br>
        United States
      </address>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.legal-hero {
  padding: var(--space-9) 0 var(--space-6);
  background: var(--surface);
  border-bottom: var(--hairline) solid var(--border);
}
.legal-hero h1 { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }

.legal-body { padding: var(--space-8) 0 var(--space-9); }

.legal-content h2 {
  margin-top: var(--space-7);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  font-size: var(--text-h3);
}
.legal-content h2:first-of-type { margin-top: var(--space-5); }
.legal-content p,
.legal-content ul,
.legal-content ol {
  max-width: 720px;
  color: var(--fg-2);
  line-height: var(--lh-normal);
}
.legal-content ul,
.legal-content ol {
  padding-left: var(--space-5);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
}
.legal-content li { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
.legal-content a {
  color: var(--navy);
  text-decoration: underline;
  word-break: break-word;
}

.post-address {
  font-style: normal;
  margin: var(--space-3) 0 var(--space-5);
  padding: var(--space-4);
  background: var(--surface-alt);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  max-width: 720px;
  color: var(--fg-2);
  line-height: var(--lh-normal);
}
</style>
